101. To the limited extent of studying the issues arising from the exercise of

 powers under
Articles 200
and

respectively, the Commission addressed

 itself on the following broad points:
(i) Scope of Governor’s discretion under
Article 200;
(ii) Interplay of
Articles 200
and

respectively of the Constitution;
(iii) Scope of Union Executive’s discretion under
Article 201;
(iv) Impropriety of conditional assent by the President;
